# A case directory's only tracked file is its manifest; everything else in one is derived and the
# runner prunes it. The anchored lines are this corpus's own harness, which is source: without them a
# new .cpp under harness/ would be ignored, and the anchor is what stops a case directory carrying one.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!manifest.json
!/harness/*.cpp
!/harness/*.h
